Fundamental supervised learning concepts including:

 - Linear regression in one dimension, 
 - Polynomial regression, 
 - Model evaluation using RMSE and R2 score
 - Analyzing overfitting and underfitting
 - Ridge regression and regularization
 - Multidimensional prediction 

using Scikit-learn in Python

data_1.txt provides data on the performances of 100 drone samples as a function of their lengths.

data_2.txt provides an extended database of the stability and velocity performances of 1200 drone samples at different configurations. 
Each configuration has 8 features and 2 labels.

The following Python packages are required:
 - scikit-learn
 - numpy
 - matplotlib
